    "updated_at": "2021-06-09T19:38:24Z",
    "body": "Good news. Full support is integrated ;-)\r\nThanks for pushing me. Should have done that a long time ago.\r\n\r\nCurrently, you need to checkout and install from the `devel` branch, as the changes are not merged to the main branch yet.\r\n\r\nEither \r\n```bash\r\ngit clone https://github.com/aspuru-guzik-group/tequila\r\ncd tequila\r\ngit checkout devel\r\npip install -e .\r\n```\r\n\r\nor install directly\r\n`pip install git+https://github.com/aspuru-guzik-group/tequila.git@devel`\r\n\r\nThe usage is the same as for the `psi4` backend.\r\nE.g.\r\n`mol = tq.Molecule(geometry=\"geomfile.xyz\", basis_set=\"sto-3g\")`\r\n\r\nLet me know if you experience any troubles with it.\r\n\r\nI will keep this issue open until the update has been merged to the main branch and released over PyPi.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
